WEBVTT

01:25.280 --> 01:30.920
‪ADAPTED FROM A SHUQI.COM NOVEL
‪ORIGINAL AUTHOR: SENLIN LU

01:36.200 --> 01:37.200
Your Ladyship,

01:38.040 --> 01:40.760
you're reviewing the case late at night?

01:43.160 --> 01:46.360
Can't we wait until tomorrow
to discuss it with His Majesty?

01:48.160 --> 01:49.000
Just thinking about Remonstrator Lu

01:49.080 --> 01:51.160
sleeping through the night
comfortably at home,

01:51.240 --> 01:52.440
I feel uneasy all over.

01:53.040 --> 01:54.520
So yes, sorry to trouble you both.

01:54.600 --> 01:56.600
After all, it's a case
His Majesty personally inquired about.

01:57.520 --> 01:59.160
Let's have Deputy Director Xiao
take the records.

02:01.000 --> 02:02.560
Then let's begin.

02:06.280 --> 02:07.440
Remonstrator Lu, please repeat

02:07.520 --> 02:09.360
what happened last night at Swallow House.

02:15.440 --> 02:17.440
I arrived at Swallow House
half past the You hour.

02:17.520 --> 02:19.840
I was meeting with Liu Ying'er
to go over the score.

02:21.240 --> 02:22.080
It's this section.

02:23.520 --> 02:25.240
Could you tell us again

02:25.320 --> 02:27.160
how you communicated with Liu Ying'er?

02:29.520 --> 02:31.440
That's improper.

02:31.520 --> 02:33.200
Your Ladyship,

02:33.280 --> 02:35.520
since you're handling the case this late,

02:35.600 --> 02:37.320
why not focus on the key points

02:37.840 --> 02:39.880
and resolve it quickly?

02:42.160 --> 02:43.680
What's there to be shy about?

02:44.400 --> 02:46.280
It would also give us a chance to see

02:46.360 --> 02:48.320
the talent
of the second-year graduate of Yongtai.

02:51.840 --> 02:53.080
Last night,

02:53.160 --> 02:55.640
Liu Ying'er played a new piece.

02:56.200 --> 02:57.960
I felt it lacked a bit of charm.

02:58.560 --> 03:00.760
So I composed some lyrics
for the new score.

03:01.360 --> 03:02.920
"Mist shrouds the silver boat,

03:04.120 --> 03:06.360
moon halo on the branches,
my heart grows obsessed."

03:07.160 --> 03:08.320
Nice lyrics!

03:08.920 --> 03:10.200
Truly beautiful lyrics.

03:10.800 --> 03:12.440
But I'm quite lacking in talent.

03:12.960 --> 03:15.360
Could you explain
the meaning of these words?

03:15.440 --> 03:18.320
It's just a few descriptive phrases
about the night sky.

03:18.400 --> 03:20.120
At that moment,
I glanced outside the window

03:20.200 --> 03:22.080
and saw the thick night mist
and the hazy moon halo.

03:22.160 --> 03:24.320
I casually wrote these two lines.

03:24.400 --> 03:25.800
Nothing special, really.

03:26.560 --> 03:28.400
You truly have an elegant taste.

03:28.480 --> 03:30.480
But how could such exquisite words

03:30.560 --> 03:32.640
make Liu Ying'er unhappy?

03:35.520 --> 03:38.600
I said the rhythm of the piece was off,
and it didn't match the lyrics.

03:38.680 --> 03:41.160
Liu Ying'er disagreed,
and we started arguing.

03:41.240 --> 03:44.240
At the second ke of Xu hour,
Liu Ying'er ran out in a huff.

03:44.320 --> 03:45.680
I got up to chase her,

03:45.760 --> 03:47.440
but accidentally fell down the stairs.

03:47.520 --> 03:48.880
The people in Swallow House all saw it.

03:49.560 --> 03:51.480
I really don't know anything
about Xiuhong House,

03:51.560 --> 03:52.720
and I certainly haven't been there.

03:52.800 --> 03:55.040
You two must have had quite an argument,

03:55.120 --> 03:57.080
which is why Liu Ying'er
ran out of the room.

03:57.160 --> 03:58.840
In your hurry,

03:58.920 --> 04:01.000
how did you know

04:01.080 --> 04:02.560
that it was exactly
the second ke of Xu hour?

04:03.360 --> 04:04.200
Yes.

04:04.800 --> 04:07.800
Why do you remember it so clearly?

04:08.440 --> 04:10.800
Because the attendant there

04:10.880 --> 04:12.720
was repeatedly announcing the time,

04:13.240 --> 04:15.000
"On the third day of the fifth month,
at the second ke of the Xu hour,

04:15.080 --> 04:17.120
Mr. Lu claims
'Hundred Birds Return to Nest'!"

04:17.200 --> 04:19.279
That was the most expensive reward
at Swallow House.

04:19.360 --> 04:21.160
So your lyrics were written

04:21.240 --> 04:23.160
before the second ke of Xu hour?

04:24.600 --> 04:25.640
Correct.

04:26.320 --> 04:27.680
The moon halo

04:28.200 --> 04:30.640
was also seen
before the second ke of Xu hour?

04:31.720 --> 04:33.000
Your Ladyship,

04:33.080 --> 04:36.360
why are we going back
to those lyrics again?

04:37.440 --> 04:39.320
On matters of the heavens,

04:39.840 --> 04:41.200
Deputy Director Xiao knows best.

04:41.280 --> 04:42.760
Let's ask him.

04:49.560 --> 04:50.960
According to official records,

04:51.040 --> 04:52.840
the moon halo appeared
at the fourth ke of Xu hour last night

04:52.920 --> 04:54.080
and completely dissipated by the Hai hour.

04:54.160 --> 04:56.000
If Remonstrator Lu saw the moon halo,

04:56.080 --> 04:57.200
it must have been
at the fourth ke of Xu hour.

04:57.800 --> 04:59.360
After you wrote the lyrics, argued,

04:59.440 --> 05:00.840
then fell down the stairs,

05:00.920 --> 05:02.200
that would've been
at least the sixth ke of Xu hour.

05:06.200 --> 05:07.760
So, you're lying.

05:08.720 --> 05:10.440
No, I'm not!

05:10.520 --> 05:11.840
Everyone, think about it.

05:11.920 --> 05:14.280
If it wasn't for that attendant
shouting out the second ke of Xu hour,

05:14.360 --> 05:15.840
how would I know the exact time?

05:15.920 --> 05:18.120
I arrived at Swallow House
half past the You hour

05:18.200 --> 05:19.560
to meet Liu Ying'er.

05:19.640 --> 05:21.000
And I really did see the moon halo.

05:21.080 --> 05:24.280
If someone is lying,
it should be the attendant.

05:24.360 --> 05:25.960
Why blame me for it?

05:26.040 --> 05:27.760
There was no water clock at Swallow House.

05:28.360 --> 05:30.280
The time was reported
by the nearby watchman.

05:30.880 --> 05:32.240
If he was in your pocket,

05:32.320 --> 05:34.000
- the hour was yours to name.
- You…

05:34.080 --> 05:35.640
With a few coins,

05:35.720 --> 05:38.360
you bought any time you pleased.

05:39.240 --> 05:40.800
Speaking nonsense!

05:40.880 --> 05:42.680
Am I speaking nonsense?

05:42.760 --> 05:44.480
Once the watchman arrives, we'll know.

05:45.480 --> 05:46.520
Don't rush.

05:46.600 --> 05:48.080
We've already caught him.

05:48.160 --> 05:49.000
He should be here soon.

05:51.120 --> 05:52.160
Remonstrator Lu,

05:53.120 --> 05:55.880
Her Ladyship has seen you
at Xiuhong House.

05:55.960 --> 05:57.880
Can't you be wronged?

05:57.960 --> 06:00.800
Rather than trying to scheme your way out,

06:00.880 --> 06:03.520
a honest confession serves you better!

06:04.320 --> 06:05.480
Alright.

06:09.280 --> 06:10.440
This case

06:10.520 --> 06:14.640
involves the inner palace.
It's a serious matter.

06:15.240 --> 06:17.280
The Court of Judicial Review will assist
the Palace Investigation Bureau

06:17.360 --> 06:18.960
in investigating it.

06:19.560 --> 06:21.160
As for Lu Zhenglian,

06:21.240 --> 06:23.760
once I report it tomorrow,

06:24.480 --> 06:26.320
His Majesty will decide.

06:26.920 --> 06:27.800
Understood.

06:46.880 --> 06:48.200
Prosecutor Gu has found Jiang Tingwei.

06:48.280 --> 06:49.720
We're short on manpower
and need reinforcements.

06:53.600 --> 06:54.880
Chief Justice.

06:57.880 --> 06:59.600
I'll leave Remonstrator Lu to you.

07:00.800 --> 07:01.640
Understood.

07:26.240 --> 07:28.000
If we do nothing,

07:28.080 --> 07:30.760
we'll have no way out.

07:43.280 --> 07:44.560
Everyone, be sharp.

07:44.640 --> 07:45.480
Strengthen the defenses.

07:45.560 --> 07:46.800
- Yes, sir!
- Yes, sir!

07:50.400 --> 07:51.760
Someone's following us!

07:51.840 --> 07:52.680
Stay alert!

08:02.240 --> 08:03.320
Stop right there!

08:05.720 --> 08:07.640
Now's the time! Move!

09:09.560 --> 09:10.680
Go save them!

09:14.920 --> 09:15.760
Taozhi!

09:27.480 --> 09:28.320
Taozhi.

09:29.320 --> 09:30.560
It's me.

09:33.640 --> 09:34.960
Lingzhou…

09:38.400 --> 09:39.880
It's my fault.

09:40.520 --> 09:41.680
I came late.

09:45.720 --> 09:46.560
Capture them alive.

09:54.280 --> 09:55.480
Everyone, step back!

10:02.920 --> 10:04.280
Take the alive ones back.

10:05.000 --> 10:06.120
Understood.

10:08.080 --> 10:08.920
Move!

10:09.520 --> 10:10.280
Get up!

10:31.760 --> 10:32.600
- Taozhi!
- Taozhi!

10:32.680 --> 10:33.640
Taozhi!

10:33.720 --> 10:34.560
- Taozhi!
- Taozhi!

10:34.640 --> 10:35.440
- Taozhi!
- Taozhi!

10:35.520 --> 10:37.000
- Taozhi!
- Taozhi!

10:38.400 --> 10:39.280
Taozhi!

10:39.360 --> 10:40.560
- Taozhi!
- Taozhi…

10:42.080 --> 10:43.000
Your Ladyship…

10:44.880 --> 10:45.720
Taozhi…

10:47.320 --> 10:48.160
Taozhi…

10:52.320 --> 10:53.520
- Taozhi…
- Taozhi…

10:54.240 --> 10:55.120
Taozhi…

11:08.440 --> 11:09.520
I'm here.

11:09.600 --> 11:10.600
I'm here.

11:11.600 --> 11:12.880
Don't cry…

11:14.760 --> 11:15.840
Let's go home…

11:17.560 --> 11:18.560
Alright.

11:19.480 --> 11:20.720
I will take you home.

11:22.200 --> 11:23.040
Let's go home.

11:23.600 --> 11:25.320
- I will take you home.
- Take me…

11:26.640 --> 11:27.560
Taozhi…

11:33.920 --> 11:34.920
Taozhi?

11:36.080 --> 11:36.960
Taozhi?

11:37.040 --> 11:38.360
- Taozhi!
- Taozhi!

11:38.440 --> 11:39.480
Taozhi!

11:39.560 --> 11:40.600
Taozhi!

11:40.680 --> 11:42.800
- Taozhi!
- Taozhi!

11:42.880 --> 11:44.200
Taozhi!

11:44.720 --> 11:46.120
- Taozhi!
- Taozhi!

11:46.200 --> 11:47.320
Taozhi…

11:47.840 --> 11:48.720
Taozhi…

11:51.040 --> 11:52.200
Taozhi…

11:54.200 --> 11:55.880
Taozhi…

12:01.600 --> 12:02.680
Taozhi…

12:02.760 --> 12:03.760
GOODS HAVE BEEN CONFISCATED

12:03.840 --> 12:06.760
LI PEIYI FOUND THE "HUNDRED BIRDS
RETURN TO NEST" FROM SWALLOW HOUSE

12:10.120 --> 12:11.640
Li Peiyi found

12:11.720 --> 12:14.040
Swallow House's reward,
the "Hundred Birds Return to Nest."

12:16.160 --> 12:17.480
As expected.

12:19.440 --> 12:21.160
Lu Zhenglian can't escape now.

12:22.560 --> 12:24.080
Xiuhong House is no longer an option.

12:24.160 --> 12:25.640
We can't save Sun Zhiwang either.

12:27.080 --> 12:29.320
Lu Zhenglian is in the same boat as us.

12:29.400 --> 12:31.720
A few stern words
should make him hesitate.

12:32.520 --> 12:34.280
But Sun Zhiwang is a businessman.

12:34.800 --> 12:38.600
Who knows what conditions Li Peiyi
will offer him?

12:38.680 --> 12:40.680
He knows a lot.

12:42.080 --> 12:43.840
Go tell your master,

12:43.920 --> 12:46.240
whether Sun Zhiwang keeps quiet

12:46.320 --> 12:48.200
depends on his skill.

12:49.600 --> 12:50.440
Understood.

12:59.920 --> 13:03.040
They don't have anything on them
that can prove their identities.

13:03.960 --> 13:05.920
I checked those
unexploded fire thunder bombs.

13:06.000 --> 13:07.000
Nothing odd.

13:07.080 --> 13:08.360
They're probably death warriors.

13:09.840 --> 13:12.160
We got word of it and rushed here at once.

13:12.240 --> 13:14.280
But those men in black
arrived earlier than us.

13:16.520 --> 13:18.480
Sun Zhiwang has such big power?

13:19.440 --> 13:20.520
It couldn't have been him.

13:22.920 --> 13:24.800
XIUHONG HOUSE

13:24.880 --> 13:25.920
Seal!

13:28.280 --> 13:29.360
SEALED
BY THE LEFT GUARD COMMANDANT'S OFFICE

13:29.440 --> 13:30.280
SUN'S MANSION

13:39.200 --> 13:40.360
Don't move!

13:56.960 --> 13:58.640
Your Ladyship,

13:59.520 --> 14:02.440
I'm telling the truth.
I haven't hidden a single thing.

14:03.560 --> 14:05.360
Xiuhong House has always
been managed by Hu Da.

14:05.440 --> 14:06.400
I never interfere.

14:06.480 --> 14:08.960
He abused his position
to kidnap palace maids

14:09.040 --> 14:10.080
and set up a brothel.

14:10.160 --> 14:11.520
It's indeed a grave crime!

14:12.280 --> 14:14.080
Indulging Hu Da was my fault.

14:14.160 --> 14:15.600
I admit my guilt.

14:15.680 --> 14:16.520
But…

14:17.040 --> 14:19.520
as for the clients he found,
how he found them,

14:19.600 --> 14:22.480
I really don't know anything about it.

14:23.680 --> 14:25.960
Don't be so hasty
to burn your bridges, Mr. Sun.

14:26.480 --> 14:28.560
Think carefully before you speak.

14:29.280 --> 14:31.280
I… Even if you push me to death,

14:31.360 --> 14:32.880
I still know nothing about it!

14:34.960 --> 14:37.040
I… I…

14:37.920 --> 14:39.840
So you are holding back.

14:40.360 --> 14:42.320
Guards, take a good look.

14:42.400 --> 14:44.440
Remove anything that could injure him

14:44.520 --> 14:46.360
and cause an accidental death.

14:50.080 --> 14:52.120
Don't try to bite your tongue.

14:52.200 --> 14:53.160
It'll be hard to die that way.

14:53.240 --> 14:54.920
Even if you die, you'll go to hell.

14:55.000 --> 14:56.600
That's terrifying.

14:56.680 --> 14:58.680
Tonight, Mr. Xiao and I won't go anywhere.

14:58.760 --> 14:59.640
We'll just stay with you.

15:00.240 --> 15:02.960
Please… hear me out.

15:03.040 --> 15:04.960
You can't blame me for this!

15:18.880 --> 15:20.280
You're still questioning him?

15:20.880 --> 15:21.760
This isn't your concern.

15:37.840 --> 15:38.880
I won!

15:42.160 --> 15:43.520
You mistook the pawn.

15:44.600 --> 15:46.880
It's clearly a black pawn.

15:47.680 --> 15:49.720
Your drawing is unclear.

15:49.800 --> 15:50.720
How can you blame me?

15:53.640 --> 15:54.640
I've been losing all the time.

15:54.720 --> 15:55.560
This is no fun!

16:03.120 --> 16:04.320
Made up your mind?

16:17.840 --> 16:19.320
Lu Zhenglian won't speak.

16:19.400 --> 16:20.600
Sun Zhiwang won't dare speak.

16:20.680 --> 16:23.600
Looks like the clients at Xiuhong House
are either rich or noble.

16:23.680 --> 16:25.240
They can't afford to offend them.

16:26.680 --> 16:29.360
Others, probably,
are like Lu Zhenglian, officials in court,

16:29.440 --> 16:30.840
which makes them so cautious.

16:30.920 --> 16:33.200
His Majesty has always disapproved
of officials meeting in secret.

16:33.280 --> 16:34.200
If that's the case,

16:34.800 --> 16:36.440
they've probably been
working together for a long time.

16:36.520 --> 16:37.480
It'll be even harder to get them to spill.

16:38.360 --> 16:39.200
No rush.

16:39.720 --> 16:40.960
We still need one last push.

17:17.839 --> 17:20.760
Li Peiyi, you're so devious!

17:20.839 --> 17:22.359
I haven't said anything!

17:22.440 --> 17:23.960
Stop shouting.

17:24.560 --> 17:26.560
Your room is at the very end.

17:26.640 --> 17:28.319
No one can hear you.

17:28.400 --> 17:30.960
But they'll know Deputy Director Xiao
questioned you for an entire night,

17:31.040 --> 17:32.520
and paper was delivered several times.

17:33.160 --> 17:34.280
They'll also know,

17:34.360 --> 17:37.120
after you confessed,
I rewarded you greatly.

17:37.720 --> 17:38.920
The situation is set.

17:39.000 --> 17:41.080
You can stay silent

17:41.160 --> 17:43.920
or take this opportunity
to tell me everything you know.

17:44.000 --> 17:45.520
I'll make sure you stay alive.

17:46.120 --> 17:48.320
- You…
- I'll give you two hours.

17:48.400 --> 17:49.400
Think it over.

17:52.560 --> 17:54.320
Watch him closely. He'll crack soon.

17:54.400 --> 17:55.480
Don't let anyone near him.

17:55.560 --> 17:57.120
- No one is allowed.
- Understood.

18:19.000 --> 18:20.080
Sun Zhiwang has confessed.

18:25.080 --> 18:28.160
He probably hasn't said anything, right?

18:29.200 --> 18:30.320
‪Is it?

18:32.920 --> 18:35.040
I thought you had some great ability,

18:35.720 --> 18:37.760
but in the end,
you're just an ignorant woman.

18:37.840 --> 18:39.360
If he really did spill,

18:39.880 --> 18:42.000
why waste time here with me?

18:43.360 --> 18:45.280
How is it wasting time?

18:46.240 --> 18:49.400
I just wanted to see your last expression.

18:51.760 --> 18:52.960
It's really interesting.

18:54.640 --> 18:57.360
Are you really going to blindly trust
Sun Zhiwang's one-sided story?

18:59.680 --> 19:01.640
Sun Zhiwang's attitude was sincere,

19:01.720 --> 19:03.480
and he spoke in great detail,

19:04.000 --> 19:05.880
far more convincingly than you.

19:07.080 --> 19:08.680
He's a businessman.

19:08.760 --> 19:10.480
Of course he'll spin the tale
to suit himself.

19:10.560 --> 19:12.440
If… If you can't see through that,

19:12.520 --> 19:13.960
you call yourself an investigator?

19:15.360 --> 19:17.360
Whatever it takes,
I won't let the guilty walk free.

19:17.960 --> 19:19.680
If you're dissatisfied,

19:19.760 --> 19:21.040
it's not Sun Zhiwang's fault.

19:21.560 --> 19:23.560
Who told you to play dumb?

19:24.200 --> 19:25.280
But I guess,

19:25.360 --> 19:27.560
when facing the executioner,

19:27.640 --> 19:29.200
you'll understand everything.

19:32.520 --> 19:33.440
Your Ladyship,

19:33.520 --> 19:36.000
the ladies provided a clear sketch.

19:36.080 --> 19:37.480
Please take a look.

19:51.120 --> 19:51.880
It's Lu Zhenglian.

19:52.760 --> 19:53.920
Your Ladyship recognize him?

19:54.800 --> 19:56.040
He's already been caught.

19:59.160 --> 20:02.040
Ruyi, do you remember
the appearance of the others?

20:12.040 --> 20:14.200
These two seniors were there before us.

20:14.800 --> 20:17.440
The sketch was only possible
thanks to them.

20:18.040 --> 20:20.600
Have you seen any other clients
without their masks on?

20:23.680 --> 20:26.520
They were very careful,
always wearing masks.

20:27.120 --> 20:29.400
Occasionally, we could catch
a glimpse of their faces,

20:29.920 --> 20:32.200
but… we didn't know who they were.

20:33.080 --> 20:35.360
Just tell the artist
everything you remember

20:35.440 --> 20:36.440
about what you saw,

20:36.520 --> 20:38.400
even the smallest details.

20:38.480 --> 20:39.600
Understood.

20:41.040 --> 20:41.880
Emergency!

20:41.960 --> 20:44.240
Prosecutor Gu is storming
the prison with a blade!

20:47.640 --> 20:48.920
Prosecutor Gu, calm down!

20:50.560 --> 20:51.400
Move aside!

20:51.480 --> 20:52.360
No!

20:55.280 --> 20:56.120
Gu Lingzhou!

20:58.160 --> 20:59.000
Don't stop me!

21:07.760 --> 21:08.600
Wuren!

21:10.200 --> 21:11.040
Where is Gu Lingzhou?

21:11.120 --> 21:12.080
Over there.

21:53.320 --> 21:56.080
Didn't I order that no one
be allowed to approach him?

21:56.160 --> 21:57.160
Why is there something like this?

21:58.360 --> 21:59.640
An… An hour ago,

21:59.720 --> 22:01.680
Sun Zhiwang
suddenly said he'd figured it out.

22:01.760 --> 22:03.320
He wants to spill everything he knows.

22:03.400 --> 22:04.680
I was coming to find you

22:04.760 --> 22:07.320
when the duty clerk reported it
to the Chief Justice.

22:07.400 --> 22:09.320
The Chief Justice knew your orders.

22:09.840 --> 22:12.000
But eager to close the case, he said,

22:12.880 --> 22:14.000
"If we can't question him,

22:14.080 --> 22:15.760
let him write it himself."

22:21.280 --> 22:23.120
The Chief Justice had you bring this pen?

22:25.840 --> 22:26.680
No.

22:26.760 --> 22:29.400
Your Ladyship ordered
that he must not commit suicide.

22:29.480 --> 22:31.480
The Chief Justice had us bring
paper and reed pens.

22:31.560 --> 22:33.240
But after writing for a while,

22:33.320 --> 22:34.840
Sun Zhiwang complained
the reed pen was too soft.

22:34.920 --> 22:36.880
I saw he really wrote a lot,

22:36.960 --> 22:38.360
so I gave him a brush instead.

22:39.000 --> 22:40.320
I kept an eye on him

22:41.000 --> 22:42.040
until…

22:43.360 --> 22:44.520
until Prosecutor Gu charged in.

22:45.400 --> 22:46.360
I ran out to assist.

22:47.160 --> 22:49.280
But Sun took advantage
of this little bit of time…

22:58.120 --> 22:59.720
The pen was already cracked.

23:00.680 --> 23:01.640
Or it wouldn't have snapped so easily.

23:02.920 --> 23:04.120
I…

23:04.200 --> 23:06.360
I really don't know about this.
I truly don't know!

23:06.440 --> 23:09.240
This pen was specially prepared by them.

23:10.920 --> 23:12.160
It's not just the pen.

23:13.000 --> 23:14.760
With all the drama here today,

23:15.280 --> 23:16.920
which one wasn't arranged by them?

23:27.400 --> 23:28.320
Your Ladyship.

23:29.480 --> 23:32.240
Lu Zhenglian, whatever it is, out with it!

23:33.640 --> 23:34.720
All I'm saying is,

23:35.760 --> 23:37.000
Princess of Fuchang County,

23:37.080 --> 23:39.200
your little confession trap
is laughably obvious.

23:42.360 --> 23:45.960
I only drank
and slept around on a workday.

23:47.160 --> 23:49.040
If you really have the skills
to convict me,

23:49.680 --> 23:52.400
cut my pay, demote me. I accept it all.

23:54.920 --> 23:56.840
But don't you dare

23:57.360 --> 23:59.040
pin Xiuhong House's filth on me!

24:00.360 --> 24:01.320
Still refusing to talk?

24:01.400 --> 24:02.640
Save your breath.

24:03.760 --> 24:05.600
Someone has already
passed a message to him.

24:05.680 --> 24:07.000
He won't say another word.

24:10.560 --> 24:12.600
But just a fine or a demotion?
Don't count on it.

24:12.680 --> 24:14.240
That wasn't just sleeping around.

24:14.880 --> 24:15.880
It was rape.

24:16.720 --> 24:18.800
If any of those women were married,

24:18.880 --> 24:20.400
add further charges.

24:27.080 --> 24:28.840
Sun Zhiwang confessed

24:28.920 --> 24:31.680
that he used Hu Da's position
in the Palace Registry Bureau

24:31.760 --> 24:33.400
to abduct ex-palace maids

24:33.480 --> 24:36.760
and imprison them in Xiuhong House.

24:36.840 --> 24:38.960
He used the embroidery house as cover,

24:39.040 --> 24:41.920
forcing the maids
to commit immoral acts for men.

24:42.000 --> 24:43.520
As for those who came seeking pleasure,

24:44.120 --> 24:46.280
they were all contacted directly by Hu Da.

24:46.360 --> 24:47.360
They used tokens of identification,

24:47.440 --> 24:48.960
showing up incognito.

24:50.080 --> 24:52.520
Now that Hu Da is dead,

24:52.600 --> 24:54.640
Sun Zhiwang has committed suicide,

24:54.720 --> 24:57.840
how can we find the other clients?

24:59.000 --> 25:01.120
As for the other clients…

25:01.800 --> 25:03.800
I'm afraid it will be difficult
to track them down.

25:07.200 --> 25:09.360
How about those maids?

25:09.440 --> 25:12.400
They have all been rescued.

25:13.280 --> 25:14.920
If that's the case,

25:15.520 --> 25:19.320
the mastermind has taken their own life,
the victims have been saved,

25:19.400 --> 25:23.520
and the corrupt officials
have been uncovered.

25:24.280 --> 25:27.720
You've done a good job with this case.

25:27.800 --> 25:31.600
You've really lived up
to His Majesty's expectations.

25:31.680 --> 25:33.640
Eunuch Guo, don't rush.

25:33.720 --> 25:35.120
This case isn't closed yet.

25:38.040 --> 25:40.560
Recently, floods in the south

25:40.640 --> 25:42.840
have kept His Majesty awake day and night.

25:42.920 --> 25:45.160
You should

25:45.240 --> 25:48.480
help His Majesty share the burden.

25:48.560 --> 25:50.400
By Your Majesty's grace,

25:50.480 --> 25:53.160
I will certainly punish them by the law.

25:56.920 --> 25:58.040
Your Ladyship,

25:58.840 --> 26:01.600
Eunuch Guo has made things very clear.

26:01.680 --> 26:03.840
The matter has caused quite a stir.

26:03.920 --> 26:06.680
His Majesty needs us to close it quickly.

26:08.120 --> 26:10.280
But while we wait
for His Majesty's decree,

26:10.360 --> 26:13.000
let us continue our investigation.

26:20.320 --> 26:22.160
Who even looks like this?

26:22.240 --> 26:23.760
The two witnesses

26:23.840 --> 26:26.440
first said one thing, then another,

26:26.520 --> 26:28.480
repeatedly changing their stories.

26:28.560 --> 26:30.000
So the sketch ended up like this.

26:30.880 --> 26:31.840
Think again.

26:32.440 --> 26:34.440
What did the person you saw look like?

26:37.280 --> 26:38.680
You're driving me crazy!

26:38.760 --> 26:39.960
What good does it do to blame us?

26:40.040 --> 26:41.800
We were very scared at the time.

26:41.880 --> 26:43.360
You were there too.

26:43.440 --> 26:45.840
Why didn't you have the courage
to take off that person's mask?

26:45.920 --> 26:46.960
Enough.

26:47.480 --> 26:48.480
Come out with me.

26:54.800 --> 26:57.040
They clearly said they saw him before.

26:57.120 --> 26:58.240
How could it end up like this?

26:58.920 --> 27:00.240
Has anyone come today?

27:00.840 --> 27:04.000
This morning, people from the Palace
Investigation Bureau came with food.

27:04.720 --> 27:06.560
Then the artist arrived.

27:07.920 --> 27:10.120
No, wait. In between, an officer
from the Imperial Medical Office

27:10.200 --> 27:11.920
came to change our bandages.

27:12.000 --> 27:13.680
There was no one else.

27:14.440 --> 27:15.920
Wasn't it that female officer
from last night?

27:17.920 --> 27:19.400
You mean the office threatened them?

27:19.480 --> 27:21.080
- Let me go ask them.
- No need.

27:21.160 --> 27:22.720
Those scoundrels
always resort to these tricks.

27:23.320 --> 27:24.400
Don't force them.

27:26.600 --> 27:30.840
PALACE INVESTIGATION BUREAU

27:43.360 --> 27:44.440
Your Ladyship.

27:49.800 --> 27:50.920
How'd you track me down?

27:51.000 --> 27:53.920
Your master told me
when you're in a bad mood,

27:54.000 --> 27:55.520
you like to stay here by yourself.

27:57.240 --> 27:59.040
You might as well say you're divining.

27:59.560 --> 28:00.800
I don't have such a habit.

28:03.400 --> 28:05.480
You're here to comfort me, aren't you?

28:05.560 --> 28:08.920
You've been working cases
at your bureau for 15 years.

28:09.000 --> 28:12.440
Losing all leads just when you're close
to cracking one,

28:12.520 --> 28:13.880
that must be nothing new to you.

28:14.680 --> 28:17.400
That said, at least pretend to comfort me.

28:18.200 --> 28:19.400
It was my oversight.

28:20.480 --> 28:21.600
Forget it.

28:21.680 --> 28:22.920
You didn't have the intention either.

28:25.680 --> 28:26.720
You've found new clues?

28:27.920 --> 28:29.840
When observing the stars
at the Astronomical Bureau,

28:29.920 --> 28:31.680
sometimes we lose track of the stars.

28:32.280 --> 28:35.080
But the stars move
following their own paths and rhythms.

28:35.160 --> 28:37.200
If one temporarily
disappears from the sky,

28:37.720 --> 28:39.320
you can find it along the path it took.

28:39.920 --> 28:41.400
It will always return there.

28:41.920 --> 28:44.720
Investigating a case
might be more complicated than stars,

28:44.800 --> 28:46.720
but the principle is the same.

28:46.800 --> 28:48.960
If a case loses its lead,

28:49.040 --> 28:50.560
you can return
to the starting point to search.

28:52.120 --> 28:53.240
You've thought of that too?

28:53.840 --> 28:55.200
The starting point of all of this

28:55.280 --> 28:57.200
is the flower that bloomed
on the palace wall.

28:58.480 --> 28:59.680
Lou Chuo.

29:00.480 --> 29:02.440
We were originally investigating
Hanxiao's death.

29:02.520 --> 29:04.880
Lou Chuo deliberately
led the suspicion to Hu Da.

29:04.960 --> 29:08.200
The place where Hu Da was killed
is near Xiuhong House.

29:08.280 --> 29:09.920
If Lou Chuo's words are true,

29:10.000 --> 29:12.000
it's because he hated Hu Da
that he killed him,

29:12.080 --> 29:14.600
why wait until three months
after Hanxiao's death,

29:14.680 --> 29:16.760
when we began investigating
the "Flower on the Wall" case?

29:17.480 --> 29:19.040
He could have buried Hanxiao
in the palace wall

29:19.120 --> 29:20.240
without anyone knowing.

29:20.320 --> 29:22.400
No need to go through all the trouble
to kill Hu Da.

29:22.480 --> 29:25.000
Lou Chuo is still hiding something.

29:32.480 --> 29:34.160
I knew you'd bring something.

29:34.240 --> 29:35.320
Out with it!

29:39.440 --> 29:43.040
The old man must've had
you bring me touhua cakes.

29:45.760 --> 29:46.840
Let's go.

30:02.320 --> 30:03.440
How is Prosecutor Gu doing?

30:03.960 --> 30:05.200
Still in deep sorrow.

30:05.800 --> 30:07.520
But since he hurt a few of the clerks,

30:07.600 --> 30:08.680
he's temporarily detained.

30:09.720 --> 30:11.440
Let him rest for a while.

30:12.440 --> 30:13.480
Make sure he's properly attended to.

30:14.080 --> 30:16.440
Anyone who dares neglect Prosecutor Gu
will be held accountable.

30:16.520 --> 30:18.640
When this case is closed,
I'll settle scores with them.

30:19.360 --> 30:20.400
Understood.

30:23.520 --> 30:24.920
Your Ladyship,
who are you going to question?

30:25.000 --> 30:26.200
Why are you asking around?

30:28.200 --> 30:29.600
I'm going to question Lou Chuo.

30:30.840 --> 30:32.520
From this moment on,

30:32.600 --> 30:35.200
if anything happens to Lou Chuo,
you're held fully responsible.

30:35.280 --> 30:37.400
I don't know who's behind you,

30:37.480 --> 30:39.160
but I know who you are.

30:39.800 --> 30:41.760
Whether or not you're one of them,

30:41.840 --> 30:44.400
Lou Chuo must live if you want to live.

31:20.600 --> 31:21.560
You were lying.

31:22.640 --> 31:24.360
You didn't harm Hanxiao.

31:25.360 --> 31:26.480
You saved her.

31:41.960 --> 31:43.120
Thank you.

31:55.800 --> 31:57.120
I actually met her

31:58.160 --> 32:01.880
in a narrow alley outside Daozheng Ward,

32:01.960 --> 32:03.360
near Chunming Gate.

32:03.960 --> 32:05.360
At that time,

32:05.440 --> 32:08.320
she lay wounded by the roadside.

32:08.960 --> 32:10.520
I didn't

32:10.600 --> 32:13.080
even know if she was still alive.

32:16.120 --> 32:16.960
Hanxiao?

32:17.600 --> 32:18.680
Hanxiao?

32:23.600 --> 32:24.440
It's…

32:25.000 --> 32:25.840
It's you?

32:28.720 --> 32:29.920
Save me…

32:30.520 --> 32:31.520
I never expected

32:33.040 --> 32:34.720
she would still recognize me.

32:37.080 --> 32:38.080
Hanxiao,

32:38.160 --> 32:39.000
I'll take you with me.

32:39.520 --> 32:40.360
Come.

32:40.960 --> 32:41.800
Take care.

32:42.400 --> 32:43.280
Come.

32:54.920 --> 32:56.480
I admired Hanxiao,

32:58.360 --> 33:01.000
but I never had
any improper thoughts about her.

33:01.760 --> 33:03.560
I took her back to my place

33:04.240 --> 33:06.200
and took care of her for three days.

33:06.960 --> 33:10.320
Only then did she regain
a bit of consciousness and speak to me.

33:11.120 --> 33:12.640
Hanxiao told me

33:14.560 --> 33:16.080
she was deceived by Hu Da!

33:18.720 --> 33:19.920
She thought

33:20.560 --> 33:22.280
she could live a decent life

33:22.800 --> 33:25.160
as an embroiderer at Xiuhong House,

33:26.000 --> 33:27.480
but didn't expect

33:28.280 --> 33:30.200
they would bully and abuse

33:30.880 --> 33:31.840
the ladies!

33:32.800 --> 33:34.520
Hanxiao escaped once,

33:35.920 --> 33:36.960
but before she could reach
the county office,

33:37.040 --> 33:38.560
she was caught and brought back.

33:39.680 --> 33:41.600
Then she was severely beaten.

33:42.480 --> 33:43.320
Later,

33:43.840 --> 33:46.320
one of the clients mistreated her so badly

33:46.920 --> 33:49.320
that they all thought
she wouldn't survive.

33:50.160 --> 33:52.400
They planned to bury her out of the city,

33:53.280 --> 33:56.120
but she found another chance and escaped.

33:56.920 --> 33:58.200
Finally, she met me.

33:59.000 --> 34:00.560
But she still didn't make it, right?

34:01.840 --> 34:02.680
Yes.

34:04.760 --> 34:05.960
She didn't make it.

34:06.560 --> 34:08.360
I tried my best.

34:09.080 --> 34:11.080
I really did.

34:12.520 --> 34:14.760
She was just too badly injured

34:15.679 --> 34:17.120
at that time.

34:18.960 --> 34:21.880
What did Hanxiao tell you
about Xiuhong House?

34:21.960 --> 34:23.920
They're a bunch of scoundrels!

34:24.560 --> 34:26.280
They all deserve to die!

34:26.360 --> 34:28.199
They don't even treat
those ladies as human beings.

34:30.000 --> 34:32.000
Hanxiao was such a good girl,

34:32.960 --> 34:34.280
and until her death,

34:35.239 --> 34:37.199
she was still thinking
about saving others.

34:38.800 --> 34:41.800
Did she mention to you
who those scoundrels were?

34:42.440 --> 34:45.440
She said she had collected
a list of their names.

34:47.080 --> 34:49.520
But she also said, I'm not their match,

34:50.360 --> 34:51.880
and I shouldn't take the risk.

34:52.960 --> 34:55.080
So, I could only kill Hu Da.

35:01.080 --> 35:02.160
I'm useless.

35:03.880 --> 35:05.920
I've let Hanxiao down.

35:08.800 --> 35:11.960
I'm just a lowly night-soil collector.

35:12.040 --> 35:14.080
I couldn't do anything.

35:25.360 --> 35:26.320
I've heard

35:26.960 --> 35:28.760
that Your Ladyship is very capable

35:29.760 --> 35:31.640
and has solved many big cases.

35:32.400 --> 35:34.320
But I couldn't see you.

35:35.480 --> 35:38.040
So you deliberately buried Hanxiao's body

35:38.120 --> 35:39.240
in the palace wall?

35:39.840 --> 35:42.000
I was just waiting for an opportunity.

35:42.080 --> 35:45.240
I didn't even know
where it would come from

35:46.240 --> 35:48.240
or how long I would have to wait.

35:49.880 --> 35:51.440
But Heaven is watching.

35:52.720 --> 35:54.040
Hanxiao's body

35:55.400 --> 35:57.360
unexpectedly bloomed with flowers.

36:04.520 --> 36:06.720
To make sure Her Ladyship
investigated Xiuhong House,

36:07.480 --> 36:08.800
you went to such lengths.

36:09.720 --> 36:11.440
But since you can even risk your own life,

36:12.440 --> 36:14.320
why not just tell her

36:14.840 --> 36:16.160
the cause of Hanxiao's death?

36:16.800 --> 36:18.240
I am not sure

36:19.040 --> 36:20.160
if the county princess

36:20.840 --> 36:23.000
can really avenge Hanxiao.

36:24.800 --> 36:26.640
Hanxiao told me

36:28.000 --> 36:29.200
those scoundrels

36:30.160 --> 36:32.240
are very powerful.

36:33.360 --> 36:35.120
I'm afraid we can't even

36:36.160 --> 36:37.360
protect ourselves.

36:41.400 --> 36:42.640
I'm not afraid of death,

36:43.920 --> 36:45.240
but Xiuhong House

36:45.760 --> 36:47.680
has many other ladies.

36:48.480 --> 36:49.960
They shouldn't die.

36:50.920 --> 36:52.240
I need to know

36:52.320 --> 36:53.160
if Your Ladyship

36:53.920 --> 36:56.360
can truly investigate this thoroughly

36:57.800 --> 37:00.360
and rescue all of them safely.

37:01.040 --> 37:02.280
Only then will I say.

37:04.120 --> 37:06.600
Even when I soaked you in that barrel,

37:07.200 --> 37:08.040
you didn't dare speak up.

37:09.240 --> 37:11.000
I wanted to tell you earlier.

37:11.080 --> 37:12.800
Hanxiao once saw

37:13.920 --> 37:15.360
one of Xiuhong House's clients

37:16.040 --> 37:18.680
at a palace banquet hosted by Consort Shu.

37:21.000 --> 37:22.520
That night, he was drunk.

37:23.120 --> 37:24.160
In the Imperial Garden,

37:24.680 --> 37:26.280
he touched Hanxiao inappropriately.

37:26.880 --> 37:28.800
Hanxiao didn't know who he was.

37:29.800 --> 37:31.400
But during the struggle,

37:32.040 --> 37:33.960
she noticed a large scar

37:34.880 --> 37:36.240
on the inside of his wrist.

37:37.160 --> 37:38.600
It was a burn mark.

37:39.640 --> 37:41.600
The banquet in Consort Shu's palace

37:42.200 --> 37:43.880
is usually only for officials

37:43.960 --> 37:45.640
above the third rank
and their family members.

37:47.440 --> 37:50.480
I only know that his rank is high.

37:52.080 --> 37:54.000
While you were questioning me,

37:54.520 --> 37:56.960
a high-ranking
official suddenly barged in.

37:58.720 --> 38:00.280
I was afraid of him.

38:02.760 --> 38:04.000
So,

38:04.680 --> 38:05.640
I changed my story.

38:06.240 --> 38:07.720
No harm in being careful.

38:08.440 --> 38:12.120
Did that man recognize Hanxiao
at Xiuhong House?

38:13.520 --> 38:14.440
No.

38:15.480 --> 38:18.160
He didn't recognize her at all.

38:19.480 --> 38:23.160
But once, when she was being whipped,

38:23.920 --> 38:25.920
he paid to have it stopped.

38:27.200 --> 38:28.160
Why stop it?

38:30.840 --> 38:31.880
Because…

38:32.960 --> 38:36.960
he said the scars
on a woman's body are disgusting.

38:37.640 --> 38:38.680
Your Ladyship,

38:39.200 --> 38:40.360
he was not being kind.

38:41.080 --> 38:43.520
To him, those ladies weren't even people.

38:45.480 --> 38:48.200
From then on, fearing him,

38:49.640 --> 38:51.680
they never whipped Hanxiao.

38:53.560 --> 38:55.160
Lu Zhenglian still plays innocent,

38:55.800 --> 38:57.320
denies ever seeing other clients.

38:57.400 --> 38:59.040
That man's rank was even higher,

38:59.560 --> 39:00.880
so Lu certainly wouldn't have confessed.

39:06.000 --> 39:07.040
Your Ladyship,

39:07.880 --> 39:09.200
Sir,

39:09.280 --> 39:10.680
please, I beg you.

39:11.840 --> 39:14.560
Make sure all these scoundrels are caught.

39:15.360 --> 39:16.920
They've harmed so many people,

39:17.480 --> 39:19.080
and they killed Hanxiao.

39:20.040 --> 39:20.920
I beg you…

39:31.240 --> 39:33.160
You've been poisoned. The bat venom.

39:33.920 --> 39:34.920
Your Ladyship…

39:36.800 --> 39:37.960
my death

39:38.640 --> 39:39.800
isn't important.

39:40.600 --> 39:44.080
But we can't just let those scoundrels
get away with it.

39:44.840 --> 39:46.440
I will do everything I can to save you.

39:47.240 --> 39:48.240
If I can save you,

39:48.760 --> 39:50.800
you'll come with me
and help bring them back.

39:51.720 --> 39:52.880
If I can't save you,

39:53.480 --> 39:55.000
I'll send them to join you!

39:58.240 --> 39:59.560
Thank you, Your Ladyship.

40:03.880 --> 40:04.720
Take him back
to the Palace Investigation Bureau

40:04.800 --> 40:05.840
- and take good care of him.
- Understood.

40:11.120 --> 40:15.280
NO GUESSWORK
NO DOGMA, NO RIGIDITY, NO EGO

40:17.840 --> 40:18.840
Don't lose heart.

40:20.720 --> 40:21.640
Why do you say that?

40:21.720 --> 40:23.360
You never comfort anyone.

40:24.280 --> 40:26.800
Lou Chuo is beyond saving,
yet you comforted him.

40:29.080 --> 40:32.880
A star that vanishes
can still be traced down by its path.

40:33.600 --> 40:36.440
But a person gone is gone forever.

40:39.360 --> 40:40.200
Do we still need to investigate?

40:41.920 --> 40:43.160
Of course, we need to.

40:43.800 --> 40:45.920
Hanxiao and Taozhi
are already dead by their hands.

40:46.520 --> 40:49.560
Who knows how many others died
without leaving a name?

40:49.640 --> 40:51.960
If even I don't continue
the investigation,

40:52.040 --> 40:53.880
who will seek justice for them?

40:53.960 --> 40:55.600
Then I will continue
the investigation with you.

40:56.200 --> 40:58.360
Lu Zhenglian thought,
as long as he keeps silent,

40:58.440 --> 41:00.720
he would only be charged
with sleeping around or even rape.

41:01.240 --> 41:04.160
But Hanxiao died after enduring
long-term abuse from him.

41:04.920 --> 41:06.040
Once a life is involved,

41:06.120 --> 41:08.200
he will surely reveal something
to save himself.

41:11.040 --> 41:11.880
I have a plan.

41:11.960 --> 41:13.600
I've thought of a way too.

41:24.720 --> 41:26.280
- Who is it?
- It's me.

41:34.440 --> 41:35.520
What's this?

41:36.240 --> 41:37.880
The wound on your arm hasn't healed.

41:37.960 --> 41:39.000
You can't identify Lu Zhenglian yet.

41:39.600 --> 41:42.080
My mother used to blend medicinal incense
and apply it in steam treatments.

41:42.680 --> 41:44.000
Strong incenses

41:44.080 --> 41:46.200
can dye the skin for a while.

41:46.280 --> 41:47.640
It will take some time to fade.

41:48.240 --> 41:51.280
Since fresh skin
stains easier than the original,

41:51.880 --> 41:54.280
steaming it will show
the shape of the wound.

41:56.440 --> 41:57.360
Then let's begin.

42:06.960 --> 42:07.800
What is this?

42:08.600 --> 42:09.680
Tattooing ink.

42:13.640 --> 42:14.680
What are you planning to do?

42:15.640 --> 42:17.840
With the original wound,
make an incision in the skin.

42:17.920 --> 42:19.000
Then apply the tattooing ink,

42:19.600 --> 42:21.240
and you'll see the shape of the wound.

42:21.840 --> 42:22.680
Then what?

42:23.360 --> 42:25.040
Then we'll be able
to identify Lu Zhenglian.

42:25.120 --> 42:25.960
But what about your arm?

42:26.760 --> 42:28.560
You plan to carry this tattoo
for the rest of your life?

42:30.200 --> 42:31.480
It's not a big deal.

42:32.520 --> 42:33.400
Don't tell me

42:33.480 --> 42:35.480
about the saying,
"The body is a gift from parents."

42:36.080 --> 42:37.440
My parents are both dead.

42:37.520 --> 42:38.480
They won't blame me.

42:41.640 --> 42:43.000
For Your Ladyship,

42:43.600 --> 42:44.640
the case comes before everything,

42:45.160 --> 42:47.840
your health, even your life.

42:48.680 --> 42:50.920
So diligent, so determined.

42:51.000 --> 42:52.240
That puts me to shame.

42:52.960 --> 42:54.440
But if you're injured

42:54.520 --> 42:56.880
when the next case breaks, what then?

42:58.560 --> 42:59.440
I know my own limits.

43:01.240 --> 43:02.720
Your limits are simply

43:02.800 --> 43:05.400
to act alone as always,
never asking for help.

43:06.760 --> 43:07.880
Is that wrong?

43:08.400 --> 43:09.640
It's simple, direct.

43:09.720 --> 43:11.160
It gets answers fastest.

43:14.720 --> 43:16.480
Have you ever seen a shooting star?

43:16.560 --> 43:17.520
Of course.

43:18.400 --> 43:21.600
Do you know why a shooting star
falls from the sky?

43:25.200 --> 43:27.040
For a star to move along its path,

43:27.120 --> 43:28.840
it's not just relying on itself,

43:28.920 --> 43:32.160
but is guided by the surrounding stars.

43:32.240 --> 43:35.280
Without that guidance,
it will fall from the sky,

43:35.360 --> 43:37.360
be burned by the fire, and turn to dust.

43:38.000 --> 43:39.480
Since you asked for my help
in the investigation,

43:39.560 --> 43:41.840
I must be the star that guides you.

43:42.440 --> 43:43.480
It's not just me,

43:43.560 --> 43:45.240
but your master, Wuren,

43:45.320 --> 43:47.760
Prosecutor Gu, and many others,

43:47.840 --> 43:49.240
who are all connected to you.

43:49.960 --> 43:52.440
You don't need to hurt yourself
in the course of the investigation.

43:53.040 --> 43:54.000
As your colleague,

43:54.080 --> 43:56.800
I will help you come up with other ways
to solve the problem.

43:56.880 --> 43:58.120
Your injury

43:58.840 --> 43:59.880
is my negligence.

44:02.120 --> 44:02.960
How troublesome.

44:03.040 --> 44:04.440
I don't mind the trouble.

44:08.040 --> 44:10.720
Because the stars guide each other.

44:26.360 --> 44:27.200
In that case,

44:28.160 --> 44:30.000
I have one more thing to ask you.

44:32.160 --> 44:34.160
When I fell into the lake

44:34.240 --> 44:36.160
in the palace back then,
didn't you see anyone nearby?

44:37.200 --> 44:39.520
When you fell into the water,
I was the only one around.

44:39.600 --> 44:41.640
The palace maids and eunuchs
were gathered on the other side.

44:44.200 --> 44:47.440
But I can be sure
I was pushed into the water.

44:49.960 --> 44:52.400
If I had seen the murderer,
I would never have hidden it.

44:52.480 --> 44:54.520
Even if it wasn't you,

44:54.600 --> 44:56.960
I would never let the murderer
get away with it.

45:00.760 --> 45:01.800
This steam feels quite hot.

45:06.400 --> 45:07.400
Is my arm cooking?

45:08.080 --> 45:09.160
Apologies…

45:22.400 --> 45:23.320
Greetings.

45:24.840 --> 45:26.400
The coroner has confirmed

45:26.480 --> 45:28.320
that Hanxiao died
after enduring long-term abuse

45:28.400 --> 45:29.640
in Xiuhong House.

45:29.720 --> 45:31.440
The scars on her body

45:31.520 --> 45:33.280
match exactly with the whip
of Lu Zhenglian.

45:33.360 --> 45:35.280
Lu Zhenglian is the one
who killed Hanxiao.

45:36.640 --> 45:38.000
Hanxiao?

45:38.840 --> 45:41.120
Wasn't she killed by Lou Chuo?

45:41.200 --> 45:43.040
After Lou Chuo met Hanxiao,

45:43.120 --> 45:44.360
he was seeking medical help for her.

45:44.440 --> 45:45.480
Without his care,

45:45.560 --> 45:46.720
Hanxiao wouldn't have lived
for more than three days.

45:48.800 --> 45:50.040
So, this means

45:50.600 --> 45:52.720
Lu Zhenglian is the true murderer?

45:53.480 --> 45:55.240
He can't be completely convicted,

45:55.320 --> 45:58.040
but he won't be allowed
to live peacefully in prison.

45:58.120 --> 45:59.160
Bring him out.

45:59.240 --> 46:00.280
I'll take him back
to the Palace Investigation Bureau.

46:00.920 --> 46:01.760
Oh…

46:02.400 --> 46:03.320
Hurry!

46:03.400 --> 46:05.560
Go get him back!

46:05.640 --> 46:07.240
- Understood.
- Get him back?

46:07.320 --> 46:08.880
Before dawn today,

46:08.960 --> 46:11.200
Lu Zhenglian was sent back
to his hometown!

46:12.080 --> 46:13.160
Who authorized that?
